If he wants him in his company

57
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,220
Then why would he try to murder him?

58
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:52,440
It just doesn't make sense to me

59
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:55,900
It might be because of his family's history with Haijima

60
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:58,500
Are you planning to tell Vulcan about this?

61
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,100
I doubt he'll believe you

62
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:02,640
After all, I don't even believe you

63
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,820
