77
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:40,720
Need to find out if this is just Giovanni

78
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,560
Or the whole of Company 3

79
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:45,080
Luckily, he doesn't know we're here yet

80
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:47,820
I'll try to scout him out from a high vantage point

81
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:50,280
We can base our next move off of what I find

82
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:56,000
We're the only ones who can fight, Arthur

83
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,440
I'm counting on you

84
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,540
Hold on!

85
00:05:58,700 --> 00:05:59,540
What was the plan?

86
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,300
Causes of death are many and varied

87
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:07,580
Kill Vulcan and his friends

88
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:09,220
A murder-suicide

89
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:12,200
Or an infernal-caused fire

90
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,540
Yes, sir

91
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:15,240
Before you go

92
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:18,160
Cast off your false raiments

93
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,360
Sir

94
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:23,280
Faithfulness to the evangelist

95
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:29,040
Why would you think that Dr. Giovanni's planning to kill me?

96
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:32,460
If one of us was about to jump to murder, it would be me

97
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:34,740
I'm the one who's got a grudge against him

98
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:36,580
Yeah, well...

99
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,140
Shinra kinda had a vision

100
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:39,660
Except it was with his ears

101
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:45,400
I hope that you guys might be different from the other fire soldiers

102
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:49,320
But making crap up just to scare me into joining you is pretty damn typical

103
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:52,240
You really can't imagine a motive for him?

104
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:54,240
You've got history with haijuma, right?

105
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:57,040
True, but I'm the one who has beef with them!

106
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,420
Vulcan!

107
00:06:58,420 --> 00:07:11,540
I think there's close to a hundred of them

108
00:07:11,540 --> 00:07:13,280
All this just to get me?

109
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:14,600
That's insane!

110
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:17,300
How did Shinra let that big a force get past him?

111
00:07:17,580 --> 00:07:19,260
What the hell's he doing out there?

112
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:22,660
Why is it so quiet?

113
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:34,700
I thought something seemed unusual at the workshop

114
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:37,420
Company 8 is on the scene, is it?

115
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:40,420
I hate surprises

116
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:48,020
Damn it!

117
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:49,480
Where are you?

118
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:51,120
Come face me!

119
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,580
Shinra Kusakabe

120
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:55,540
The rookie who possesses an Edole burst

121
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:58,980
I'll capture him and take him to the Evangelist

122
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:02,000
What the?

123
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:09,000
They're flying that thing by controlling the booster in its wrist

124
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,920
Must be a second generation

125
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:15,220
Just follow the wire

126
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:21,340
They're gone

127
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:26,860
Damn you!

128
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:29,340
What kind of monster is he?

129
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,680
That's two million volts of current

130
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,300
Well then

131
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:41,020
Your friends at the workshop are currently meeting the same fate as you

132
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:54,520
Is the enemy behind that tree?

133
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:55,840
What if he's not?

134
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,460
What if he has allies?

135
00:08:58,160 --> 00:09:01,560
Should I create a diversion and wait to see how he reacts?

136
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:05,560
Had you considered every possibility you'd still be standing?

137
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:07,700
Because you would have fled

138
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:10,900
Recognizing that you cannot defeat me

139
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:16,120
One should knock on a bridge to test its strength before stepping forward

140
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:19,920
This is Dr. Giovanni

141
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:22,420
I've made a serendipitous catch

142
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:23,960
Requesting retrieval

143
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,580
Yes, that's right

144
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:26,180
Yes, that's right

145
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:28,660
The young man with the Edole burst

146
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:33,020
Now that you've fallen into my hands

147
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:37,020
We're one step closer to realizing the Evangelist's dream

148
00:09:37,020 --> 00:09:39,640
All that's left for us to do

149
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:42,500
Is take that key from Vulcan

150
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:45,580
You two are fire soldiers, right?

151
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:47,140
Can you fight these guys?

152
00:09:47,800 --> 00:09:49,860
I could, but I didn't bring my sword with me

153
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:51,240
And to be honest

154
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,980
I don't feel very knightly at the moment

155
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:55,700
When I don't feel like a knight

156
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:57,480
My flames get really weak

157
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,460
Huh?

158
00:10:00,580 --> 00:10:03,300
Like, I need a weapon that feels more swordly

159
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,480
Give me something with more swordliness

160
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,740
And I'll get way stronger

161
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:11,720
If you seek Arthur Boyle's protection

162
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,200
Then you should know

163
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,580
The more I look like a knight

164
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,320
The greater my power grows

165
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,440
That's why they call me the Night King

166
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,720
Yeah, I could tell at a glance

167
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,520
You're as dumb as I thought

168
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:27,240
So, if I help you to dress up like a knight

169
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,400
Then you'll get stronger

170
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,240
Is that right?

171
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:34,660
Knightly

172
00:10:34,660 --> 00:10:36,540
Knightly

173
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:38,460
Yeah

174
00:10:38,460 --> 00:10:40,120
A brave steed

175
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:43,960
Mirage

176
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:46,820
Wait back here and maintain our perimeter

177
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:48,420
As you say

178
00:10:48,420 --> 00:10:51,960
I will bust in there and clear the place out

179
00:10:51,960 --> 00:11:03,520
Vulcan

180
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:05,980
You just tied a tarp to his shoulders

181
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:07,540
Is that really going to help him?

182
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,340
That's not all I did

183
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:11,440
It's based on how he feels, right?

184
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,140
Well, he seemed happy enough when he went out there

185
00:11:14,140 --> 00:11:23,720
Yeah, but come on

186
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,520
He doesn't look like a knight at all

187
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:28,440
I mean, there's a donkey head strapped to his crotch

188
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:37,860
My king commanded me to defend the princess and her courtesans

189
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:40,340
I vowed to chop you villains to bits

190
00:11:40,340 --> 00:11:43,020
And use you as grist in that mill

191
00:11:43,020 --> 00:11:45,160
Who are you?

192
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,340
I doubt you're from the workshop

193
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:53,620
Arthur's sword got a lot stronger

194
00:11:53,620 --> 00:11:54,900
More than it's ever been

195
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:55,520
Huh?

196
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:55,560
Huh?

197
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,320
So it actually worked?

198
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,820
Right forth, silver

199
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:06,520
In the name of the round table

200
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:09,960
I smite thee

201
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,760
And go over

202
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:15,360
What was that attack?

203
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,320
My shimmers

204
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:21,760
All those troops

205
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,500
I cut through them

206
00:12:23,500 --> 00:12:24,780
Like so much paper mache

207
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:27,260
Guess the workshop hired a fighter

208
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:29,820
Strange that we weren't let in on that fact

209
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:31,020
All right, punk

210
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:32,180
State your name

211
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,560
I am the Night King

212
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,500
Arthur Boyle

213
00:12:34,500 --> 00:12:36,800
Second class fire soldier of the eighth

214
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,760
You've met your match, kid

215
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:43,080
Stay on guard

216
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,020
The will of his flame is strong

217
00:12:45,020 --> 00:12:46,600
Right

218
00:12:46,600 --> 00:13:01,040
Holy crap

219
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,820
That idiot's a powerhouse

220
00:13:02,820 --> 00:13:08,480
When a knight and his steed fight is won

221
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:09,740
They can't lose

222
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:27,420
Though there be many of you

223
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:29,520
I'll hold strong and let none pass

224
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:32,040
You might look completely ridiculous

225
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,060
But you've got strength

226
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:36,880
Does my knightly garb look silly

227
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,640
To a foul bandit such as you?

228
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,520
These are fakes!

229
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,760
Surrender at once

230
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,560
You've lost

231
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:54,420
Good grief

232
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:56,540
Who would wear such a ridiculous costume?

233
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,700
Seems you would

234
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:58,060
Huh?

235
00:13:59,140 --> 00:13:59,700
Wait

236
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:00,580
That's me?

237
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:01,940
No way

238
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,820
This is so unknightly

239
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:27,520
Upon closer inspection

240
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:29,040
My steed

241
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:31,860
Looks more like a donkey than a horse

242
00:14:31,860 --> 00:14:38,540
Hey

243
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:39,820
What happened?

244
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,440
It sounds like Arthur's not doing too well

245
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:47,020
No

246
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:48,480
Silver

247
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,620
The hell are you doing?

248
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,080
This some kind of joke?

249
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,560
You can bust my poor ass

250
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,480
But you can't break my will

251
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:01,340
His power's been greatly reduced

252
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:05,600
You'll pay for this

253
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:10,920
Looks like the guys out back were illusions too

254
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,040
Lisa

255
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:12,580
Yeah

256
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:13,860
This is your chance

257
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:15,500
Go make a run for it

258
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:16,840
You there

259
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:17,700
From the 8th

260
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:18,740
Go with them, alright?

261
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:20,020
Get them to safety

262
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,880
What are you gonna do?

263
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,720
It's me, the guys in wider after, right?

264
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:27,200
So your chances are better if we split

265
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,120
No way

266
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,320
We are not gonna ditch you to save ourselves

267
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:32,060
If we're leaving, then you should too

268
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,020
You said that we're a family, right?

269
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:38,980
Idiot or not

270
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,940
That guy out there is fighting for me

271
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,140
I can't just up and abandon him

272
00:15:43,140 --> 00:15:46,060
Why are these people after you anyway?

273
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,180
If you want me to run?

274
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:50,400
Then at least tell me that much

275
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:52,000
Couldn't tell you

276
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:52,900
Look

277
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:57,200
All I know is that Hajima took everything my ancestors had

278
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,780
Their achievements

279
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:00,260
And their lives

280
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:02,020
Achievements?

